    "name": "What needs to change for the Utah Jazz after starting 1-7? | Jazz Notes",
    "description": "The Utah Jazz find themselves at the bottom of the Western Conference standings with a record of 1-7. Yesterday, Utah took the New Orleans Pelicans to overtime but lost despite a 39-point performance from Keyonte George. With constant improvement from Darryn Peterson and Ace Bailey, can the Utah Jazz turn it around anytime soon? These podcasts are available on YouTube with video, typically after the audio version is posted. Sign up for the Jazz Notes newsletter! Receive game updates, exclusive analysis and chances to win Jazz tickets. Check out Ben and Chandler's X profiles - @BensHoops + @CHoltSports You can be a part of the Jazz Notes podcast by submitting questions for our mailbag through Ben's X on Mondays!",
